RVC on Apple's GPU, for the Mac install (macos/setup.sh applies it to the pinned commit; Docker and Windows do not).
Inert unless asked: training moves to the GPU when RVC_TRAIN_DEVICE=mps, singing (conversion and audition) when
RVC_INFER_DEVICE=mps, both of which voice/server.py sets when VOICE_DEVICE=mps.  Without it RVC trains and sings on a
Mac's CPU, at about half the speed.

